msgid "Testing with in-memory databases"
msgstr "使用内存数据库进行测试"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Some databases like H2 and Derby are commonly used in \"embedded mode\" as a facility to run quick integration tests."
msgstr "一些数据库（如 H2 和 Derby）通常采用 \"嵌入式模式\"，作为运行快速集成测试的工具。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our suggestion is to use the real database you intend to use in production; container technologies made this simple enough so you no longer have an excuse. Still, there are sometimes\n"
